+/// The J604 (MacBook Pro 14-inch, M4) GPU ladder, separate from the Air gate:
+/// eleven voltage groups topping at 1578 MHz and 1060 mV, whose derived limit
+/// is 26288 mW at the 24800 mA clamp. The Air gate above stays as it is —
+/// it pins ten groups at 1470 MHz — so the J604 is judged here instead. The
+/// ceiling leaves headroom for a higher-mA clamp on units whose loader
+/// derives one (this board's sgx sets gpu-supports-higher-mA).
+fn j604_platform_rejection(core_mask: u32, groups: usize, max_mhz: u32, max_power: u32)
+    -> Option<&'static str> {
+    if !air_core_mask_allowed(core_mask) {
+        Some("core mask")
+    } else if groups != 11 {
+        Some("performance groups")
+    } else if max_mhz != 1578 {
+        Some("maximum frequency")
+    } else if max_power == 0 || max_power > 27000 {
         Some("maximum power")
     } else {
         None
